# Open PR (no merge)

When the user asks to **create a PR**, **open a PR**, or **make a pull request** (without shipping/merging), read and follow [`.cursor/skills/open-pr/SKILL.md`](../skills/open-pr/SKILL.md).

For merge-to-main release, use the `ship-staging` skill instead.

Do **not** run unless the user explicitly requests a PR.
